.TH QDOCK-SERVER-GUI 1 "September 2026" "0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qdock-server-gui \- graphical launcher for the Quansheng LAN server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qdock-server-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
Select a serial device, listening address, TCP port and optional capabilities,
then start or stop qdock-server. PTT is disabled until explicitly selected.
The window does not start acquisition automatically.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/qdock/lan-token
LAN token read before starting the server. Configure the same token in the client.
This file is not created or overwritten by the package installer.
.SH NOTES
The GUI starts qdock-server from the same binary directory.
Closing the GUI stops its server process.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qdock-server (1),
.BR Icom7300Mk2Control (1)
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/qdock-server/INSTALAR.md
